## Reviewer got wrong (not applied)

- A2 / the Q17 verdict line. Restoring “os tribunais aplicam atualmente, em geral, cerca de 3 / 4 / 6 meses” undoes R3. The English column still has the stronger sentencing line; the Portuguese softening is the advertising rule, not a reversal to fix.
- U+200B spacers and “Q16–Q20 are not headings”. Both match the Korean source. The checker fails if either changes. They are source layout, not Portuguese prose errors.
- “ato de estado civil” for a marriage or divorce already formed abroad (007 §5) is the European Portuguese name of a status act. It is not the 戶籍 mistranslation the verdict describes.
- “governação” in 004 (listing / internal control) and 018 (board structure of a company limited by shares) is corporate governance, which is the right word. Only the Kaohsiung office line, where the English is running the business, was changed to “gestão”.
- Column 010 image alts that say “1,57 milhões de TWD” are translations of news headlines, not the guidance bio. A21 was applied only to the bio. “TWD 1.57M” stays byte-identical.
